Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Ninth Episode\NMr. X\NHecate's Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The X-Union.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Its forces have finally approached the border of Silverland.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The massive X-Union army has destroyed Demon Mountain in its path,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and now nothing stands between them and the invasion of Silverland.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Ghana, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander a message from headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We are ordered to conquer Demon Mountain before the main force arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon Mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you could make it, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, why are you practicing with bows and spears?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the X-Union is going to attack Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have to protect my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess there are bad humans too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.89,0:03:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But humans can care for each other and fall in love, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are wonderful, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, there's nothing wrong with you falling in love with a human, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To fall in love with a human...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, it is time for the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that time already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:03:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see you later, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's meet in the forest by the mountain in one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you be careful of the X-Union too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.57,0:04:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you too, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire told me that even I could fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.37,0:04:44.11,Karaoke - 49 hecate's smile - Hecate Dancing,,0,0,0,,{\k24}La {\k20}la {\k30}la
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:45.11,Karaoke - 49 hecate's smile - Hecate Dancing,,0,0,0,,{\k5}{\k22}La {\k27}la {\k16}la {\k28}la
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.12,Karaoke - 49 hecate's smile - Hecate Dancing,,0,0,0,,{\k5}{\k27}La {\k167}la
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, it's no use hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see right through your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to fall in love with a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a demon's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fall in love with a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.14,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the Great Demon King will punish you terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, tell Hecate how terrifying the Great Demon King's punishment is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the Great Demon King's punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The punishment the Great Demon King inflicts on us is truly terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.09,0:06:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't disobey your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Papa, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off to the Demon Convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.01,0:06:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, or we'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this snake charm with you so I'll know if anything happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's set up to alert me right away if something goes wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Off you go, Papa! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander! The demons have left!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Bring down that mountain! Ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:06:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you are a demon's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fall in love with a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the Great Demon King will punish you horribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Keep firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! Papa! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Demon Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a demon's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.66,0:07:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a witch, so you're going to burn at the stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you want to fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,she's a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Witch or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,she's just a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What about, the invasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We must consult Lord X first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, miss, show me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone fetch the medical kit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll turn bad if we leave it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare a horse for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, miss, I must take you to Lord X.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with us quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.18,0:08:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, what is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:08:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a nice name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm Ghana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must have happened to Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My charm broke, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly hope not...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.14,0:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone! Our house is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could she have been kidnapped by someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There are tracks from a large group passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is! Hecate is there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.10,0:09:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A demon! A demon! This is a demon's work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't return my beloved daughter Hecate...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you suffer even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.57,0:10:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mephisto, was it? Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am X, a human demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you, I seek to build a world of evil on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A world of evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall bring this world under evil's rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Mephisto?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not join forces with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How fascinating. If you're serious, I'd be happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll gladly lend you our aid. But first...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,yes, first we want our daughter Hecate returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I'll return her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Provided you fulfill my condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,, A condition!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture Princess Sapphire of Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will give back your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, little birds. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to meet Hecate here today, little birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:12:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's late. It's way past the time we agreed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! We're in luck finding you in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:25.18,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Zubarosha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth am I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto captured me and brought me to this X-Union tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If we let Sapphire escape, Lord X will have our heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.83,0:13:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done well, Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,X, now that we have captured Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland is practically ours for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it is all thanks to you and your group.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.74,0:13:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to save Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the tent where Sapphire is being held.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.39,0:13:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You were watching Sapphire's tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help Sapphire. She's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, I... No, I can't possibly do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana, even if the person giving you orders is evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then, Ghana. I'll save Sapphire myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a troublesome girl. Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the talk for outside, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.97,0:14:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sapphire! Sapphire has escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:15:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! At this rate, all three of us will get caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! You're not getting past me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, we'll be safe once we reach the Black Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Ghana is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.46,0:15:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana let Sapphire escape?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you all dawdling for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go catch Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,X, panicking won't help you catch Sapphire now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord X, that demon's daughter over there helped Sapphire escape too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto, it seems your daughter put Ghana up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.03,0:16:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a bad situation, Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I have a plan. Lend me Ghana downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring Sapphire back for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll handle this alone, so promise you won't get in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Take Ghana with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly promise you, X.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Sapphire and Hecate will come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. If we take Ghana there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,, soft-hearted Sapphire and Hecate are sure to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:37.37,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Zubarasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:48.86,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Eraisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Sapphire and Hecate will know Ghana is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you start a fire...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:17:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My magical fog and fire project Ghana's giant form into the night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.28,0:17:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, Sapphire! Ghana! It's Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana! Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.09,0:17:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana, so you really were captured after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you like that commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.95,0:17:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But didn't I tell you before that even a demon can fall in love with a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it seems Ghana is beyond that mountain. Let's hurry, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.67,0:17:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Those footsteps must be Hecate and Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wait and see what Hecate does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana! Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake, Ghana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.13,0:18:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, stay back! It's dangerous! It's a trap! Run, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Ghana? I'm going to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Hecate! Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything I told you! Come down right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.05,0:18:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hecate. Come down quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you listen to us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Hecate. Hurry and get down! Forget about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana, I can't just forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, Papa, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Papa, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.23,0:18:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to save Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you haven't forgotten what happens
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,if you fall in love with a human, have you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.23,0:19:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, Papa made a deal with X! Hurry up and come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A deal with X?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Mephisto! X isn't the kind of man to keep a promise! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time. Are you ready to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Hey! That bastard X!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! We have to get Ghana down, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Hurry, hurry! It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Ghana! Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.51,0:19:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, it won't untie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Hecate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.75,0:19:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous! Get down, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,More cannonballs are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that hateful X!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll blow you away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitors, watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.56,0:20:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you defeat X,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It means you've taken the side of Hecate, who loves a human!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you defeat X, you must face my punishment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you truly prepared for that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You will side with X!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry, Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, Ghana.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Is Hecate okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.89,0:21:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.53,0:21:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die! Hecate! Hecate! Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Curse you, X!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Impudent humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with mocking a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.81,0:21:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my final magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.16,0:21:26.16,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Zubarasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.99,0:22:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, watch your mama's magic carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.55,0:22:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.28,0:22:11.06,Madame Hell Spells,,0,0,0,,Mizu yo! Mizu yo! Sakamake! Uzumake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.28,0:22:11.06,Madame Hell Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,O Water! O Water! Surge! Swirl!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:13.76,Madame Hell Spells,,0,0,0,,Zubarasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.71,0:22:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What foolish demons, sacrificing their own lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:22:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We must retreat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.59,0:23:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Be cursed, you fools who broke the Great Demon King's law!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.71,0:23:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As punishment from the Great Demon King, Mephisto...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.44,0:23:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You shall become a mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.68,0:23:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.62,0:23:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you shall become a lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You will never return to your demonic forms!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.79,0:23:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hecate,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.30,0:23:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall punish you too so you can never be a demon again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.17,0:23:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You shall become a pitiful human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.93,0:23:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who will grow old and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.96,0:23:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.90,0:23:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.92,0:24:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, your Papa and Mama cast that rainbow wishing for your happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.17,0:24:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They are saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Go into the human world and be happy with Ghana.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.46,0:24:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.62,0:24:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.98,0:24:48.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.62,0:24:51.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.62,0:24:51.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.98,0:24:55.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.74,0:24:58.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.74,0:24:58.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
